# Auto detect text files and normalize them to LF in the repository AND in the
# working tree. `text=auto` alone normalizes only the stored blob; the working
# tree still follows core.eol, which is `native`, so a Windows checkout gets CRLF
# while the ubuntu-latest CI runner gets LF. Prettier defaults to endOfLine "lf",
# so `npm run format:check` failed on all 51 tracked text files on Windows and
# passed in CI, from byte-identical content. Measured 2026-08-08. The same defect
# class stood 76 tickets down in orbit-api the same night.
* text=auto eol=lf
